      "description": "GR Linker 是理光 GR II, GR III, GR IIIx, GR IV 相机（包括HDF版本）Wi-Fi 无线传送照片专用工具，通过它你可以把相机中的照片和视频无线传输到手机。\n支持 JPG、RAW、MOV 格式的照片和视频的浏览和下载。\n支持快速连接相机、滑动多选照片、批量并发下载。\n\n- 连接\n支持简单配置相机，实现快速连接相机。\n- 浏览\n支持浏览相机照片，以及照片Exif信息。\n- 选择\n支持滑动多选照片，快速加入下载列表。\n- 下载\n支持批量并发下载，并保存到系统相册。\n\n---------------\n\nGR Linker is a specialized tool for Wi-Fi wireless photo transfer for Ricoh GR II, GR III, GR IIIx and GR IV cameras (including the HDF Edition).\nWith this tool, you can wirelessly transfer photos and videos from your camera to your phone.\nIt supports browsing and downloading of JPG, RAW, and MOV format photos and videos.\nIt also supports quick camera connection, swipe to select multiple photos, and multitasking concurrent downloads.\n\n- Connect\nEasily configure for a quick connection.\n- Browse\nBrowse photos on your camera and view photo Exif information.\n- Select\nSwipe to select multiple photos and quickly add them to the download list.\n- Download\nDownload multiple items concurrently and save them to the system album.\n\n---------------\n\n用户协议：\nhttps://solotechstudio.com/terms/chinese\n\n隐私政策：\nhttps://solotechstudio.com/privacy/chinese\n\n联系我们：\n如遇任何问题，请发送邮件到 support@solotechstudio.com\n\n：）",
